    spNameTeamUp: 'Team up',
    spNameFrontRow: 'Front Row',
    spDescFrontRow: 'Yous live stage dey take top of stage rail while it run, on every surface dat list stage, wey dey have stage.',
    spNameDeepCurrent: 'Deep Current',
    spDescDeepCurrent: 'Giv yu one of yu boosts to somebody else post. Top step be di one dat spend yu reach for other people.',
    spColUnlocks: 'Unlocks',
    spMinShort: 'min',
    spNoAllowance: 'No allowance',
    spRotationDesc: 'Da slot dey rotate, no da pins. When many boosts dey run at once, each viewer get one, but how much dey get depend on how high da booster’s badge tier be — higher tier dey show more often, but everybody still get da window dem pay for. What a boost buy is share of voice for a set time, no full control of da top of da feed.',
    spCycleDesc: 'Dis cycle na platform-wide fourteen days, so everybody’s allowance go fill up at same time. No ting go roll over. Cancel booking before start, minute go back to cycle you pay for dem.',
