    feeDisclaimerDesc: 'Pis fee na go apply for service wey like tip, subscription, pay-per-view, watch2earn bounty, etc. User go send token for free from one user to another inside app, no need for wallet address or private key management. Abstraction tools wey we provide go help you do dis na easy way.',
