    q3_2026_items: ['Di web repository don go public under MIT licence — every line fo di app di ship fo open ✅', 'Stages don grow from live audio room go full broadcast stack: scheduling, reminders, short invite links, go-live from browser witout OBS, screen share, audience chat an live crowd even bifo di doors open ✅', 'Live subtitles fo stages, weh dem translate go any language weh pipul fo di room di read, plus live dubbing fo di host yi own cloned voice, weh you di pay by di minute wit DeHub tokens ✅', 'Every stage di record, wit playback weh you fit jump front an back, an corner player weh web an mobile share ✅', '@assistant don go live fo posts, comments, live chat an direct messages wit real tools instead fo keyword matching, yi di open support tickets weh go reach real person, an yi di build apps weh you describe give yi ✅', 'Creator Studio v2: native generation studio wit Canva-style editor, multi-track video editor, render queue weh everybody share, ElevenLabs audio, 3D model generation, free asset library, di Creator Flow canvas an sixteen presets ✅', 'You di pay fo AI generation wit DeHub tokens, fo price weh dem tell you bifo every job, plus five free starter images fo every wallet ✅', 'Di feed di translate yi sef go your language witout ask you fo wallet, an you fit dub any video go your language fo your own device free ✅', 'Brand poster an banner rendering don become free an yi di give di same result every taim fo SM Template 2.0 renderer, an dem don re-render every blog banner an share card fo di new style ✅', 'Six new appearance themes — War, Osaka, Jungle, Island, Hacker an Horror — weh mek di platform get fourteen full skins ✅', 'Di arcade don open wit six games: King\'s Gambit chess, Jungle Trail, Street Slayer, Claude of Duty, di God\'s Eye community globe an Chartopia — trading floor weh you fit waka insai, weh still di run fo VR headset — an yi don start fo take submissions from oda developers afta dem review dem ✅', 'Sign in wit Google, Apple, Telegram, code weh dem send fo your email, SMS code, passkey or wallet, run plenti identities from one browser, an delete your account by yourself from Settings ✅', 'Di badge ladder price dey fo dollars, no bi token count, price no fit ever take back tier weh you don earn, an you fit borrow badge give anoda account — one slot fo every step weh you climb ✅', 'Badge now di add weight fo weti you do: view or reaction di count more as your tier high pass, fo di same ladder as governance voting ✅', 'All twelve SuperPowers don go live, an Team up di allow reach eight accounts fo join dia wallet power togeda ✅', 'Creators di mark post as mature wen dem di write yi, an viewers di choose if dem want see dem, so adult an graphic work fit stay fo DeHub witout reach home feed ✅', 'Kids Mode: mode weh PIN di protect, weh di show only posts weh dem make fo pikin dem ✅', 'Ten reactions wit double-tap an triple-tap, pinned comments an di ones weh get di biggest tip di show first, Common Ground mode an AI tone assistant insai di comment box ✅', 'Direct messages don get end-to-end encryption, wit editing, replies, reactions, suggested replies, docked chats an full-screen calls ✅', 'Dem don rebuild live streaming fo DeHub yi own ingest wit playback weh near real-time, screen sharing, camera looks, permanent stream key, chat fo every stream, gift animations weh get level dem, an replays ✅', 'Multi-posting: publish fo X, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, Farcaster an eight oda platforms from di DeHub composer ✅', 'Articles: long-form mode insai di composer wit formatting, cover image an drafts ✅', 'Di DeHub exchange: order book, buy an sell quick quick, Easy trade from di wallet, an community pools fo any token fo Base, Ethereum, Robinhood Chain or Solana ✅', 'Marketplaces fo username, account an fraction ✅', 'Di mini app store wit SDK an Sign in with DeHub, so dat anybody fit build apps weh di run insai DeHub ✅', 'Custom emoji, sticker an GIF packs weh badge holders make, plus full emoji picker ✅', 'Di DAO treasury page an DAO proposals, plus governance votes weh dem di check fo server wit seven-day window an ten-wallet quorum ✅', 'Di wallet don reach Solana, Robinhood Chain an Arc, you fit send tips an payments wit almost any token, an buying don move go DeHub Pay wit card or crypto from $0.50 ✅', 'Di Converter di bring content from twenty-one sources, whole channels one taim, an podcasts tru RSS feed ✅', 'Cinema: find weh you fit watch any film or series ✅', 'DePIN backup node tier weh di run fo browser ✅', 'New members don become full directory wit chip weh di follow di name everywhere an guided walkthrough weh you fit choose, an moderation don move go insai admin panel wit chat powers an report log ✅', 'Dem rebuild wallets an sign-in from start to finish, an minting no bi by force again — publish off-chain witout any wallet at all an mint later if you want ✅', 'Mobile don catch up fo feeds, stages, posting, messaging an notifications ✅', 'Daily posting allowance, an anything weh pass yi go cost DeHub tokens: ten text posts an one gigabyte free every day, yi di increase wit your staking badge reach 100 posts an 10 GB ✅'],
