    paragraph2: 'DeHub get right fo reject any use fo DeHub token dem fo di DeHub Platform. DeHub reject any responsibility fo any direct or consequential loss or damage fo any kain weh i kam direct or indirect fo: (i) wen pipul depend fo any information weh dem give, (ii) any error, omission or inaccuracy fo any such information; or (iii) any action weh i kam fo such information.',
    paragraph5: 'Dis website, an di Website, fo any part fo am an any copy fo am, no suppose go any kontri weh distribution or spreading fo dis document dem an yi information dey prohibited or restricted. No regulatory authority neva check or approve any fo di information weh dey fo dis document reach today. Di publication, distribution or spreading fo dis terms no mean sey dem don follow di law dem, regulatory requirement dem or rule dem weh dem apply.',
    paragraph8: 'Ol statement dem fo dis website or weh dem kam fo any connection wit di DeHub entity fo social media, or di wan dem weh dem make fo press release dem or fo any place weh di public fit reach, weda na tok, oral or written, fo yi founder dem, team member dem or any third party weh i di act fo DeHub, or statement dem fo historical fact, na "forward-looking statements". No information weh dem give suppose bi business, legal, financial advice or advice fo contribution or participation fo di development fo di DeHub network an any fo yi project dem. DeHub no di make or want make, an i di disclaim hia, any representation, warranty or undertaking fo any form at all fo any entity or person, including any representation, warranty or undertaking weh i concern di truth, accuracy, an completeness fo any fo di information weh dey fo wi website.',
    paragraph9: 'Ol DeHub recipient dem dey responsible fo put reasonable measure dem fo secure dem own wallet, vault or oda storage mechanism weh dem di use fo receive an hold DeHub token dem, including any private key dem or oda credential dem weh dem need fo access dat storage mechanism dem. If any private key or oda access credential lost, di holder fit lose access fo yi DeHub Token dem. DeHub no dey responsible fo any loss, cost or expense weh i concern access credential dem weh dem don lost. DeHub no go get any obligation fo any form at all fo yu about DeHub token management. Na di token holder yi full responsibility fo withhold, collect, report an pay di correct tax dem fo di correct tax authority dem about any DeHub token dem weh i receive. DeHub no go ever hold custody fo moni or yu seed phrase, an wi or anybodi weh i dey wit DeHub no go ever ask yu fo dis information fo any situation.',
