    effective: 'Effective:',
    effectiveDate: 'July 15, 2021',
    heading: 'Legal Disclaimer',
    paragraph3: 'Na level wey law wey applya get permit, na wey DeHub no write down different, DeHub token wey airdrop, na "as is" na "as available" basis, no warranty wey any kind, na DeHub wey dey say no, all warranty wey implied for DeHub token, like wey dey say token wey fit sell, fit use for particular thing, ownership na no copy-right, all dem wey no dey list, no dey include; (i) DeHub no say na no guarantee wey DeHub token dey reliable, dey update na no error, na wey dey fix error wey dey in token no dey happen; na (ii) DeHub no can na no dey say na guarantee wey token na no delivery wey token dey free from virus na harmful thing wey any.',
    paragraph4: 'No wan part a dis website, no wan part a DeHub document, no wan part a information a dis, no fit wey wey dey represent prospectus, no fit wey wey dey represent offer document a any type, no fit wey wey dey mean wey wey dey offer securities, no fit wey wey dey mean wey wey dey ask people fo\' invest in securities a any place. If you decide fo\' come join and get DeHub tokens, please note wey any contribution wey you do fo\' DeHub platform no mean wey wey dey exchange value fo\' any type a securities, investment units, no fo\' any type a shares a project, a platform, a DeHub, no a any company a related. Digital assets fit wey dey new thing, fit wey dey technical innovation, so dey come fo\' volatility and unpredictability. Only go wey wey you can afford fo\' lose. DeHub dey operate on BNB chain, where KYC dey require fo\' all intermediaries. DeHub no dey take third party issuer liability, and all KYC enquiries fit wey dey ask a respective BNB issuer.',
    paragraph6: 'Na fullest extent wey law, rule, na regulation wey apply dey allow, DeHub, na founder, team member, na any third party wey involve in project, no go be responsible for any loss wey come from direct, indirect, special, incidental, consequential, na any other type wey come from contract, tort, na any other way (include but no limit to loss of revenue, income, profit, na loss of use or data), wey come from or connect to any acceptance or trust wey people put on information wey dey in website dis, na any part wey dey, na information wey dey on DeHub web page.',
    paragraph7: 'Wetin law a go, wey DeHub na wey DeHub parties no go dey blame for any damage wey no direct, special, incidental, consequential, or exemplary, any type (including, but not limited to, loss of money, profit, use, data, or business interruption) wey come from or connect to distribution or use of DeHub, no matter wey case a go, whether contract, tort (including, but not limited to, simple negligence, active, passive, or imputed), or any other legal or equitable reason (even if party know wey damage possible and no matter wey damage foreseeable); na (ii) in no event, aggregate blame of DeHub na affiliate parties (together), whether contract, warranty, tort (including negligence, active, passive, or imputed), or other reason, wey come from or relate to DeHub or use or no use of DeHub.',
